{#- Conch template — GEMMA family.

    Gemma's OWN turn tokens (<start_of_turn>/<end_of_turn>), so generation stops
    on Gemma's real EOS, and NO foreign tool format: llama.cpp derives its chat
    parser by RENDERING the template, so whatever it builds is something Gemma
    was trained to emit. The one thing removed from Gemma's stock template is
    its hard `raise_exception` on role order — Codex over /v1/responses sends a
    system turn plus tool turns that never alternate, and the stock template
    kills the request with 400 "Unable to generate parser for this template ...
    Conversation roles must alternate" before a single token is generated
    (measured on the owner's phone 2026-09-13: gemma-3-4b, llama.cpp b10712).
    Upstream has the same class of bug open and unfixed (ggml-org/llama.cpp
    #20733), so the patched template is the lever.

    Gemma has no system role: system/developer text is folded into the first
    user turn. Tool results arrive as user turns, labelled. Content may be a
    string or a list of parts — /v1/responses sends both. -#}
{%- macro flatten(c) -%}
    {%- if c is string -%}{{- c -}}
    {%- elif c is iterable and c is not mapping -%}
        {%- for part in c -%}
            {%- if part is string -%}{{- part -}}
            {%- elif part is mapping and part.text is defined -%}{{- part.text -}}
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
{{- bos_token -}}
{%- set ns = namespace(system='', opened=false) -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
    {%- if message.role == 'system' or message.role == 'developer' -%}
        {%- set text = flatten(message.content) | trim -%}
        {%- if text -%}
            {%- set ns.system = ns.system + ('\n\n' if ns.system else '') + text -%}
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
    {%- if message.role != 'system' and message.role != 'developer' -%}
        {%- set text = flatten(message.content) | trim -%}
        {%- if message.role == 'assistant' or message.role == 'model' -%}
            {{- '<start_of_turn>model\n' + text + '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
        {%- else -%}
            {{- '<start_of_turn>user\n' -}}
            {%- if not ns.opened and ns.system -%}
                {{- ns.system + '\n\n' -}}
                {%- set ns.opened = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if message.role == 'tool' or message.role == 'function' -%}
                {{- 'Result of ' + (message.name | default('the tool', true)) + ':\n' -}}
            {%- endif -%}
            {{- text + '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if not ns.opened and ns.system -%}
    {{- '<start_of_turn>user\n' + ns.system + '<end_of_turn>\n' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt -%}
    {{- '<start_of_turn>model\n' -}}
{%- endif -%}
